abstract: >-
  mdeinR is an R package for detecting and scoring the five dimensions of
  Memorable Dining Experiences (MDE) — sensory, affect, behavioral, social,
  and intellectual — from free-text restaurant reviews. It implements
  sentence-level scoring with valence-shifter adjustment, a built-in
  sentence tokeniser, and a bundled valence-shifter table, all without
  external NLP dependencies.
